    "note": "Third reader: as passed by its first chamber (Senate third reading passed 2025-02-28); amendments made after the version read are not in the text read. Floor amendments struck 'person or an entity' (now federal firearms licensee or law enforcement agency), 'organization' from the contract list, and 'traded in' (now 'surrendered'); added the program definition, the stolen/evidence exemption in 5-902(A), 5-903, 5-904 and 5-905. Also amends 5-114(b) (revocation of dealer's license for violating Subtitle 9), not quoted. Quotes join parts of the same section: 5-902(B)(1)(I), (B)(1)(II) and (C) (the (B)(2) contract authority is omitted); 5-901(C) quote is the amended definition."
